Vazhikatti is a web-based, indoor navigation SaaS platform designed for healthcare facilities to
reduce visitor direction confusion and lower the time for navigation by guiding the patients to
their exact location. By leveraging QR code scanning and dynamic web based navigation, the
platform guides patients and visitors directly to hospital departments, rooms, and facilities as per
their desired location. The system reduces information desk crowding, cuts down staff
interruptions, and equips hospital administrators with real-time operational traffic analytics.
